--========================================================================
-- RobuxEditor v3  |  Blue Binary-Matrix Panel + Robux text spoofer
-- Client-side display only. Changes text drawn on your own screen.
--
-- v3 changes:
--  * ADVANCED DEBUG MODE (DEBUG flag below + "Debug Dump" button in panel)
--  * GUI parents via gethui()/protect_gui when available — fixes the
--    toggle not appearing until some other CoreGui activity happened
--  * BuyButton fix: the visible text is a CHILD named "Text" inside
--    BuyButton (it is not the .Text property of BuyButton itself).
--    v3 finds the actual TextLabel and locks it during the sequence so
--    Roblox's UI can't overwrite "Processing..." etc.
--  * Robux matcher widened + everything it scans/hooks/skips is logged
--========================================================================

